  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 1e5712bb71e3a6548b767c3e23438cd6, type: 3}
  m_Name: Tutorial
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  lines:
  - "Oh! I see you\u2019re new around here. My name is Atsuko, nice to meet you"
  - "Let me explain\u2014around here at night we wash kittens\u2026 It\u2019s a pretty
    fun job, and I want you to learn how to do it."
  - You could start by getting out of there and washing the kitten I have right behind
    me
  - What? Why is a cardboard box talking to you?
  - "THAT DOESN\u2019T MATTER!"
  - Left-click to throw a little bubble from your weapon. It might take a couple
    balloons to clean it.
  - "Now, note the red machines will help reload your weapon\u2014just get close
    to one and it\u2019ll fill up like magic."
  - "I\u2019m glad to hear you understood everything. "
  - There`s been so many of them and they wont stop coming, can you help us getting
    rid of them? We can take them to an adoption center, BUT FIRST...
  - you can start with Bibble, my cat, look for him in the diner and try showering
    him first, but be careful, cats hate water
